id: 20
hanzi: 豪华
pinyin: háo huá
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Adjective

meanings_summary:
  en: luxurious; lavish; sumptuous; opulent; splendid
  es: lujoso; suntuoso; fastuoso; opulento; de gran lujo

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Adjective | Standard | lavishly decorated, sumptuous, highly expensive, and opulent in appointments or lifestyle | decorado con suntuosidad, sumamente costoso, espléndido u opulento en instalaciones o estilo | 豪华酒店 (luxury hotel)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 这座豪华的海景度假酒店设施一应俱全，窗外便是碧海银沙，吸引了许多游客前来度假。 | Zhè zuò háohuá de hǎijǐng dùjià jiǔdiàn shèshī yìyīng-jùquán, chuāngwài biàn shì bìhǎi-yínshā, xīyǐn le xǔduō yóukè qiánlái dùjià. | This luxurious oceanfront resort hotel is fully appointed; with azure sea and white sand outside, it attracts numerous holidaymakers. | Este lujoso complejo turístico frente al mar cuenta con todos los servicios; sus vistas de arena y agua turquesa atraen a muchos viajeros.
  #2 | 鲁迅常去的北京广和居饭馆虽然称不上豪华，但菜肴风味地道，极适合好友促膝畅谈。 | Lǔ Xùn cháng qù de Běijīng Guǎnghéjū fànguǎn suīrán chēngbùshàng háohuá, dàn càiyáo fēngwèi dìdao, jí shìhé hǎoyǒu cùxī-chàngtán. | Although Guangheju restaurant where Lu Xun dined could hardly be called luxurious, its authentic flavors were perfect for intimate talks. | Aunque el mesón Guangheju que Lu Xun frecuentaba no era lujoso, su sazón castizo era idóneo para largas sobremesas de amigos.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  豪华客房 | deluxe guestroom
